        "body": "Addresses #16364\r\n\r\nProblem: PR #14005 introduced a regression in the shared app-server client facade where resolving or rejecting a server request waited for the response write to finish; after tool-call-related app-server requests, that could stop the client from draining the event stream, which fits the bug report's \"tool calls are emitted and then the session gets stuck\" symptoms.\r\n\r\nSolution: Make server-request resolution fire-and-forget in both in-process and remote app-server client transports, keep write failures in the worker as warnings instead of blocking the caller, and add regression tests that verify resolve/reject return immediately after enqueueing.\r\n",
